    <p class="msv-hero__intro">The Non-Lucrative Visa is the most common route for non-EU retirees moving to Spain — but it's not the only option, and it's not right for everyone. Here's a clear comparison of all realistic routes for retirees, including their income requirements, limitations, and long-term implications.</p>
  </div>
